The Amulet is carried by the High Priest of Moloch.  To get it, you have to
kill him, so you have to go to Moloch's sanctum.  This is why you are trying
to perform the invocation with the bell, book, and candalabrum.

To quote the Oracle:

It is said that thou mayst gain entry to Moloch's sanctuary, if thou
darest, from a place where the ground vibrates in the deepest depths of
Gehennom.  Thou needs must have the aid of three magical items.  The
pure sound of a silver bell shall announce thee.  The terrible runes,
read from Moloch's book, shall cause the earth to tremble mightily.  The
light of an enchanted candelabrum shall show thee the way.

You need all seven candles in the candelabrum; you need the Bell of Opening;
you need the Book of the Dead.  Then you need to do them all together; one
one way twqat you can do it is: ring the bell, light the
candalabrum, read the Book.  There is no reason you should be unable to read
it... when you do so, a really spiffy Invocation happens and you will
find a staircase to Moloch's sanctum.

